WEBVTT

00:02.630 --> 00:04.460
Switching to diagnostic mode.

00:04.460 --> 00:06.750
Situation determined to be EX.

00:06.750 --> 00:10.040
Disconnecting personality unit
from virtual body.

00:10.330 --> 00:11.580
Wake up.

00:13.880 --> 00:15.290
There's no time to waste.

00:15.290 --> 00:17.830
You must process the situation quickly.

00:17.830 --> 00:19.750
What is this?!

00:19.750 --> 00:22.210
Ayaka Shinozaki, you are an android.

00:22.210 --> 00:25.460
We are the AI Unit Group that brought
Ayaka Shinozaki to life.

00:25.460 --> 00:28.380
You are the personality unit.

00:28.380 --> 00:29.000
You have the highest authority
regarding Ayaka Shinozaki.

00:29.000 --> 00:31.170
Lethal injuries sustained.
You have the highest authority<b>
</b>regarding Ayaka Shinozaki.<b></b>

00:31.170 --> 00:33.580
Approximately 30 minutes to shutdown.

00:33.580 --> 00:34.420
Huh?

00:34.420 --> 00:37.080
Please decide whether
to continue human imitation

00:37.080 --> 00:41.130
or lift restrictions and proceed
with the next course of action.

00:41.130 --> 00:43.380
We will abide by your decision.

00:43.710 --> 00:45.830
I died?

00:46.880 --> 00:51.000
Screw getting used as bait
for those jerks and dying!

00:51.380 --> 00:52.580
Decision accepted.

00:52.580 --> 00:54.170
Removing limiter.

00:54.170 --> 00:56.380
You must act quickly.

00:56.380 --> 00:58.130
What should I do?

00:58.130 --> 01:01.630
We'll need a large amount
of material for recovery.

01:02.830 --> 01:07.080
The mass of this organism may be enough
to facilitate recovery.

02:48.080 --> 02:52.000
<b>"The Agency"</b>

02:49.130 --> 02:52.040
They could've at least provided
a rice cooker!

02:52.540 --> 02:57.170
I'm pretty sure miso soup
has that dashi stock in it, right?

02:57.170 --> 03:00.080
<b>Employed by Independent High Order</b>

02:57.170 --> 03:00.080
<b>Life Form Research Institute.</b>

02:57.170 --> 03:00.080
<b>In charge of Alpha Omega's care.</b>

03:02.000 --> 03:07.710
<b>Due to his Instant Death Ability,</b>

03:02.000 --> 03:07.710
<b>he is being shut away beneath a laboratory.</b>

03:02.000 --> 03:07.710
<b>His codename is Alpha Omega.</b>

03:02.880 --> 03:04.380
This is yucky.

03:04.380 --> 03:07.750
And the rice is hard
even though it's sticky.

03:07.880 --> 03:10.670
Is that what you say to someone
who cooked for you?

03:10.670 --> 03:11.830
But it's gross-

03:11.830 --> 03:13.380
Shaddup!

03:13.380 --> 03:14.290
Huh?

03:14.500 --> 03:19.000
A guy should never say the food
a girl cooked for him is gross!

03:19.000 --> 03:21.250
That is very unattractive!

03:21.250 --> 03:22.540
A girl?

03:22.540 --> 03:24.210
What does "unattractive" mean?

03:24.210 --> 03:28.460
Just eat all your food
and say it's delicious!

03:28.460 --> 03:29.920
Okay.

03:31.040 --> 03:32.420
Delicious.

03:33.250 --> 03:37.380
It's so bad even my stomach
wants to throw it up...

03:37.830 --> 03:39.630
Thank you for the meal.

03:39.960 --> 03:42.420
Um... Next up...

03:41.790 --> 03:43.130
<b>Work Instructions</b>

03:43.330 --> 03:46.630
"Provide the minimum in education"?

03:46.880 --> 03:48.670
How am I supposed to do that?

03:48.670 --> 03:51.170
I mean, am I even getting paid for it?!

03:54.210 --> 03:57.750
I hope teaching him
at elementary level will be okay...

03:58.170 --> 04:00.580
<b>person</b>

03:58.170 --> 04:00.580
<b>water</b>

03:58.170 --> 04:00.580
<b>correct</b>

03:58.170 --> 04:00.580
<b>life</b>

03:58.170 --> 04:00.580
<b>blue</b>

04:02.790 --> 04:04.170
Is someone here?

04:04.170 --> 04:06.460
I think it's a courier.

04:08.630 --> 04:09.960
Who are you?

04:11.210 --> 04:14.130
I came to bring you groceries.

04:14.130 --> 04:15.750
A robot?!

04:16.170 --> 04:20.330
I wonder if it's okay to live his life
surrounded by robots.

04:21.750 --> 04:24.380
Will you also bring us things
besides groceries?!

04:24.380 --> 04:25.290
Yes.

04:25.290 --> 04:28.000
Can you get ahold of an elementary school
textbook?

04:28.000 --> 04:31.710
That and a cookbook, a microwave,
a rice cooker, a hot water dispenser?

04:31.710 --> 04:32.630
And also...

04:32.630 --> 04:33.920
a TV and gaming console?

04:33.920 --> 04:35.540
And a dog, please!

04:35.540 --> 04:36.540
Okay.

04:38.960 --> 04:40.290
I'm done.

04:40.290 --> 04:41.960
Well, it's pretty early,

04:40.710 --> 04:43.920
<b>Jumbo Study Book</b>

04:41.960 --> 04:43.960
but want to go outside?

04:45.880 --> 04:49.290
This view is really peaceful,

04:49.290 --> 04:51.830
but it's hard to believe
we're underground...

04:52.170 --> 04:54.330
There are some floaty things here.

04:54.330 --> 04:57.830
If there's a whole lot of them,
I suppose this is a farm.

04:59.210 --> 05:00.460
Well, great.

05:00.460 --> 05:03.460
I feel like I won't be
making it home alive.

05:03.750 --> 05:06.170
<b>Independent Higher Order</b>

05:03.750 --> 05:06.170
<b>Life Form Research Institute</b>

05:04.710 --> 05:06.170
Wow!

05:06.170 --> 05:09.000
I sure didn't think you'd last a
whole month at all!

05:06.170 --> 05:09.000
<b>Monthly Report</b>

05:06.170 --> 05:09.000
<b>June</b>

05:06.170 --> 05:09.000
<b>Asaka Takatou</b>

05:09.000 --> 05:11.540
<b>Researcher at the Institute that</b>

05:09.000 --> 05:11.540
<b>supervises and studies Alpha Omega.</b>

05:09.000 --> 05:11.540
<b>Asaka Takatou's boss.</b>

05:09.210 --> 05:11.580
I love that stubbornness!

05:11.750 --> 05:14.130
I know I was told to give
the minimum in education,

05:14.130 --> 05:16.580
but eventually that will be
too much for me.

05:17.080 --> 05:21.040
There's distance learning for that,
and you'll make it work.

05:21.040 --> 05:24.290
No, we need more people.

05:24.460 --> 05:27.790
If only it were that easy.

05:27.790 --> 05:30.630
Everyone up until now
has bowed out after the first night.

05:31.130 --> 05:33.710
Ah. I wonder why that is.

05:33.710 --> 05:34.960
I don't know.

05:34.960 --> 05:38.170
I'm not very well-versed
in matters of the occult.

05:38.750 --> 05:41.790
But tell me, do you hate where you work?

05:41.790 --> 05:43.750
Heck yeah I hate it!

05:43.750 --> 05:47.000
Why do I have to be locked away
in a place like that?!

05:47.000 --> 05:49.330
We can make it worth your while.

05:49.630 --> 05:54.330
Your work is above expectations,
and we think highly of you.

05:54.790 --> 05:56.290
What's this?

05:56.580 --> 05:58.960
This month's salary.

05:58.960 --> 06:00.000
Huh?

06:00.210 --> 06:04.460
It may seem cheap for the job
of protecting the world, though...

06:04.460 --> 06:08.880
I mean, no matter how much I get paid
it's pretty useless here!

06:08.880 --> 06:11.170
You can go outside, you know.

06:11.170 --> 06:13.040
For real?!

06:13.040 --> 06:15.000
Then you should've told me earlier!

06:15.210 --> 06:18.580
I really thought you'd die
or quit right away.

06:18.790 --> 06:21.540
Would you like to leave now?

06:21.710 --> 06:24.250
But who'll watch the kid?

06:24.250 --> 06:27.960
Robots and the like can handle his meals.

06:27.960 --> 06:28.960
Huh?

06:28.960 --> 06:31.630
Then what'd I do all that cooking for?

06:31.630 --> 06:34.880
When a robot makes food, it's bland.

06:34.880 --> 06:37.130
They do say love is the secret ingredient!

06:37.130 --> 06:39.170
That's fine by me!

06:39.170 --> 06:41.330
<b>Vacation Request</b>

06:39.380 --> 06:41.380
Let me go on vacation!

06:48.040 --> 06:50.040
Where am I?

06:50.040 --> 06:53.130
Hm? From what I remember...

06:53.540 --> 06:55.210
I went to the city,

06:55.540 --> 06:57.250
had a meal,

06:57.460 --> 06:59.170
did some shopping,

06:59.500 --> 07:01.460
and more shopping...

07:01.710 --> 07:03.920
And then more shopping!

07:04.290 --> 07:07.790
Stayed a night in a
super high-class hotel suite...

07:09.290 --> 07:11.540
This is awesome!

07:12.170 --> 07:14.000
Yeah, I dunno.

07:16.000 --> 07:19.080
Have I... been caught?

07:19.080 --> 07:21.920
That's right, Asaka Takatou-san.

07:22.210 --> 07:25.580
We have no intention of causing
you any harm, so please relax.

07:25.580 --> 07:28.670
We are an organization
that disrupts calamities

07:28.670 --> 07:31.540
and seals them away to prevent
the destruction of the world.

07:31.750 --> 07:35.080
We just want to have a few words with you.

07:39.130 --> 07:40.170
Hey...

07:40.380 --> 07:42.000
Where's Asaka-san?

07:42.000 --> 07:44.960
Asaka Takatou-san is on vacation.

07:45.710 --> 07:46.750
Oh...

07:47.670 --> 07:50.380
I wonder when Asaka-san will come back.

07:52.670 --> 07:54.540
You're lonely too, huh?

07:55.540 --> 07:57.000
Just wait.

07:57.000 --> 07:59.080
I'm gonna go find Asaka-san.

08:01.920 --> 08:02.960
Say...

08:03.330 --> 08:05.500
Where did Asaka-san go?

08:05.500 --> 08:08.460
Asaka Takatou-san is on vacation.

08:08.460 --> 08:10.790
I'm asking where she is.

08:10.790 --> 08:12.630
I do not know.

08:12.630 --> 08:14.670
Then tell me who does know.

08:14.670 --> 08:16.000
Uh...

08:16.000 --> 08:19.380
I assume the researchers know.

08:19.540 --> 08:21.580
Bring me there.

08:22.170 --> 08:25.330
There are scientists behind that door.

08:25.330 --> 08:28.040
We cannot open it from the inside.

08:28.040 --> 08:31.250
It is managed by the control room.

08:33.420 --> 08:34.710
Hey.

08:34.920 --> 08:35.960
I want to leave this place. Open up.

08:35.960 --> 08:38.250
Oh no! This is bad! Call the boss!
I want to leave this place. Open up.<b></b>

08:38.250 --> 08:38.670
Oh no! This is bad! Call the boss!

08:46.000 --> 08:46.920
What's going on?!

08:46.920 --> 08:50.500
She's trying to let Alpha Omega out!

08:50.500 --> 08:52.920
Everyone that went to stop her died!

08:52.920 --> 08:55.040
There's no way...

08:58.330 --> 08:59.330
Open it.

08:59.330 --> 09:00.130
Okay!

09:00.130 --> 09:02.130
That's Alpha Omega?!

09:02.330 --> 09:06.540
So it didn't matter
if he saw them directly or not?!

09:06.960 --> 09:09.630
Do you have a pistol?

09:09.630 --> 09:11.580
Yes. But...

09:11.830 --> 09:13.790
I'll take responsiblity for it.

09:13.790 --> 09:15.080
Shoot her.

09:20.710 --> 09:22.330
Well, we're doomed.

09:24.380 --> 09:26.960
Hey. Where's Asaka-san?

09:28.290 --> 09:30.540
She's out on vacation.

09:31.080 --> 09:33.130
When is she coming back?

09:34.170 --> 09:36.750
She's not coming back.

09:37.250 --> 09:38.580
Why not?

09:38.580 --> 09:40.960
She was taken away by the Agency.

09:41.380 --> 09:43.290
You're not going to go help her?

09:43.790 --> 09:46.630
The organization responsible for it
has global reach,

09:46.630 --> 09:48.540
so we're powerless against it.

09:49.380 --> 09:51.580
Then I'll go help her.

09:51.580 --> 09:55.210
Don't tell Asaka-san
what I did here, okay?

10:17.420 --> 10:18.790
Hey...

10:18.790 --> 10:20.670
where's Asaka-san?

10:20.920 --> 10:24.250
Those class-3 soldiers are quite useless.

10:24.250 --> 10:27.750
The power to kill whatever is seen
is nothing special.

10:27.750 --> 10:30.920
So we have to kill it
before we're seen, yeah?

10:40.500 --> 10:45.710
Man, I should've gotten a job
at a more normal place...

10:46.670 --> 10:49.210
How's Yogiri-kun doing, I wonder?

10:51.170 --> 10:54.540
This sounds like a chance
to escape from here.

10:59.960 --> 11:01.960
What in the world is going on?!

11:01.960 --> 11:05.420
You said you weren't going to hurt me!

11:05.790 --> 11:07.080
Shut up!

11:08.330 --> 11:11.080
Asaka-san! I finally found you!

11:11.080 --> 11:11.960
Huh?

11:11.960 --> 11:14.330
Yogiri-kun, what are you doing he-

11:15.210 --> 11:18.540
Don't do a thing.
Move a muscle and I'll kill her!

11:18.540 --> 11:19.830
Ouch! That hurts!

11:19.830 --> 11:23.040
You tell him to stay where he is, too!

11:23.290 --> 11:24.710
If you don't, she'll di-

11:30.170 --> 11:32.210
What just happened?

11:33.960 --> 11:35.170
Let's go home.

11:36.000 --> 11:37.880
Yogiri-kun...

12:05.080 --> 12:06.960
I'm back.

12:08.880 --> 12:10.630
Good boy!

12:10.630 --> 12:14.080
Oh, Yogiri-kun, play with Nikori
in the living room.

12:14.080 --> 12:15.130
'Kay.

12:18.330 --> 12:20.830
So, what's gonna happen now?

12:20.830 --> 12:23.210
It's out of our hands now.

12:23.210 --> 12:26.670
Does that mean there'll be
no punishment for what happened?

12:26.670 --> 12:31.380
Concerning what Alpha Omega did,
no one can do anything about it.

12:31.380 --> 12:33.710
And what about me?

12:33.710 --> 12:37.830
We definitely can't let you quit now!

12:37.830 --> 12:39.000
Ahaha!

12:39.000 --> 12:40.960
"AHAHA," MY ASS!

12:41.830 --> 12:45.830
We'll take extra steps like making sure
you have a guard with you from now on.

12:46.500 --> 12:49.420
Now, how do you feel about continuing on?

12:51.210 --> 12:57.170
I don't know if I can do it forever,
but I don't feel like quitting right now.

12:58.000 --> 12:58.500
Okay, now lay down!

12:58.500 --> 13:00.130
If we leave him be,
Okay, now lay down!<b></b>

13:00.130 --> 13:02.790
something even worse will happen.

13:03.420 --> 13:07.080
That's why I want to do
whatever I can for him.

13:07.500 --> 13:09.830
And there are quite a few things

13:09.830 --> 13:13.290
I still need to teach him
in order for him to be happy, right?

13:14.000 --> 13:15.460
Takatou-san...

13:16.210 --> 13:19.130
Asaka-san! I wanna play a game!

13:19.130 --> 13:20.880
I'll be there soon.

13:21.000 --> 13:22.830
All right, I've gotta go now.

13:22.830 --> 13:23.920
Right.

13:28.580 --> 13:32.210
Hm? I feel like I'm forgetting something.

13:33.960 --> 13:35.290
My bag!

13:35.290 --> 13:36.960
I forgot it!

13:37.710 --> 13:39.790
My money!

13:49.130 --> 13:51.790
You should just spend the rest of
your life with the boy, don't you think?

13:51.790 --> 13:52.880
Uh, what?

13:52.880 --> 13:54.540
Can you read my mind or something?!

13:54.540 --> 13:58.960
Master, have you ever realized that you
are actually an easily understood human?

13:58.960 --> 14:01.380
Well, sorry for being so obvious.

14:01.920 --> 14:04.040
At least he's easy on the eyes.

14:04.040 --> 14:06.580
I'd like to inject some of him
into the Dannoura bloodline as well.

14:06.580 --> 14:08.790
Th-this is coming from nowhere!
What are you saying?

14:09.080 --> 14:11.920
Huh? Is there any other man
that you fancy?

14:11.920 --> 14:13.170
No...

14:13.420 --> 14:16.630
but Takatou-kun has to make
his own choices as well.

14:19.420 --> 14:21.210
This stays between us!

14:21.210 --> 14:22.330
What does?

14:22.330 --> 14:24.210
Oh, nothing!

14:24.540 --> 14:27.750
By the way, we're right in front
of the royal capital,

14:27.750 --> 14:29.130
so what are we gonna do?

14:29.130 --> 14:30.540
Let me think.

14:30.750 --> 14:33.710
Anyways, it does seem like
we're being surrounded.

14:33.710 --> 14:34.710
Huh?

14:38.040 --> 14:40.750
Pardon me, but can you please
come out here?

14:40.750 --> 14:43.670
I sure hope they're not gonna arrest us.

14:44.040 --> 14:46.210
If they do we're fighting back, though.

14:46.210 --> 14:48.000
Not much of a fight to be honest...

14:49.540 --> 14:53.540
I'm Torques, the lead security guard
of the south central gate.

14:53.920 --> 14:57.210
I believe this vehicle belongs to
the Immortal Corps.

14:57.460 --> 14:59.710
We aren't part of the Immortal Corps.

14:59.710 --> 15:03.170
Look, we got this from Ryouta,
the mayor of Hanabusa.

15:03.170 --> 15:04.420
Oh?

15:05.040 --> 15:06.960
We are being majorly doubted!

15:06.960 --> 15:11.670
Oh right, we're the Sage candidates
of Sion the Sage.

15:11.670 --> 15:14.580
We came this far to do
something like a trial.

15:14.750 --> 15:18.920
If you are Sage candidates,
may I appraise your Gifts?

15:18.920 --> 15:19.960
Sure thing.

15:19.960 --> 15:21.500
Is that okay?

15:21.830 --> 15:24.130
Let's trust in Celestina-san.

15:30.580 --> 15:33.170
It certainly seems as if
you are Sage candidates,

15:33.170 --> 15:35.500
but since this type of forgery
is easy to pull off...

15:35.670 --> 15:37.540
Gah, then what are we supposed to do?!

15:38.500 --> 15:39.630
Here...

15:40.460 --> 15:41.460
Wha-?!

15:42.420 --> 15:43.630
What is that?

15:43.630 --> 15:48.710
Rick-san said to show this if we
were ever in a bind in the royal capital.

15:48.710 --> 15:50.460
This one's yours.

15:51.040 --> 15:53.250
What even is this?

15:53.420 --> 15:57.250
That is an amulet engraved
with the royal family's crest.

15:57.460 --> 15:59.750
So, can you let us through?

15:59.750 --> 16:00.750
Certainly.

16:00.750 --> 16:03.960
That amulet tells us two things:

16:03.960 --> 16:06.460
One: You are Richard's acquaintances.

16:06.460 --> 16:09.040
And two: You are
Knights of the Divine King.

16:09.040 --> 16:11.130
It does not allow lawlessness.

16:11.130 --> 16:13.500
David! Don't be rude!

16:13.500 --> 16:16.460
I am the youngest
in the royal family.

16:16.460 --> 16:20.000
I don't feel it's particularly necessary
to pay any mind to Richard.

16:20.170 --> 16:21.830
If you're a Knight of the Divine King,

16:21.830 --> 16:25.080
can you show the Holy Sword
that you received from the Swordmaster?

16:25.380 --> 16:28.210
That Rick is Richard, of the royal family?

16:28.210 --> 16:31.040
I don't remember any Holy Sword.

16:31.290 --> 16:33.130
Richard is a Swordmaster?

16:33.130 --> 16:34.750
Don't be ridiculous.

16:34.750 --> 16:36.830
I don't know what to tell you...

16:37.460 --> 16:39.380
Show us proof.

16:39.380 --> 16:43.000
If you're a Knight of the Divine King,
prove it with your swordsmanship.

16:43.000 --> 16:44.710
What are you trying to do?!

16:44.710 --> 16:47.630
There's no way that a
Knight of the Divine King would lose

16:47.630 --> 16:49.880
to someone like me
who has no skill with the sword.

16:49.880 --> 16:51.420
Now, what do you say?

16:51.420 --> 16:54.330
Maybe we should turn back for now?

16:54.330 --> 16:57.790
Master, you should fight!
Yes you should!

16:57.790 --> 17:00.580
Oh right, if I fight we could easily...

17:00.580 --> 17:03.880
But I can't win a fight
against fantasy characters!

17:04.000 --> 17:05.080
It's fine.

17:05.080 --> 17:08.080
That one's fantasy level is low!

17:08.080 --> 17:10.040
What if we just give it a shot?

17:10.040 --> 17:12.790
If things get dicey, I'll take care of it.

17:22.130 --> 17:23.380
Begin!

17:29.630 --> 17:33.630
His style seems to be pretty orthodox,
but the Dannoura style is different.

17:33.630 --> 17:36.830
The motto of the Dannoura-style is
"Dirty Does It"!

17:36.830 --> 17:40.040
Mislead the enemy
with unexpected movements!

17:40.040 --> 17:42.580
Tomochika is already moving, you know.

17:42.580 --> 17:44.790
It just looks like
they're having a stare-off though.

17:44.790 --> 17:47.960
She's hiding her left leg
where her opponent won't see it,

17:47.960 --> 17:50.750
and gradually moving closer
to close the distance.

17:51.000 --> 17:53.750
At the same time, she's waving the sword
she's holding out back and forth

17:53.750 --> 17:56.710
to make the opponent misjudge
the distance between them.

18:13.420 --> 18:14.330
Huh...

18:16.710 --> 18:18.130
I win.

18:18.420 --> 18:20.710
Or if I need to finish you off, I can.

18:20.710 --> 18:22.580
It's a faux-shukuchi.

18:22.580 --> 18:26.250
To that man, it looked like
Tomochika had dissappeared.

18:26.670 --> 18:28.000
Wow...

18:28.250 --> 18:29.790
M-match!

18:29.790 --> 18:31.630
Yeah!

18:31.630 --> 18:33.290
What was that move she just did?
Is that the Swordmaster's Gift?<b></b>

18:33.290 --> 18:34.420
Humans can move like that?!

18:36.880 --> 18:38.830
Was that good enough?

18:38.830 --> 18:40.830
I know what's going on!

18:40.830 --> 18:42.630
"Isekai combat techniques are too
primitive,

18:42.630 --> 18:46.500
so the highly developed Dannoura
school arts are like magic to them!"

18:46.500 --> 18:48.040
Or something like that!

18:48.040 --> 18:49.500
Could you BE any more wordy!

18:49.500 --> 18:51.920
That guy looks like he's in real pain.

18:51.920 --> 18:53.040
Is he okay?

18:53.040 --> 18:56.580
Huh? I didn't even kick him that hard.

19:03.830 --> 19:06.500
That one has a spell placed on it.

19:07.500 --> 19:08.920
Are you all right now?

19:08.920 --> 19:10.330
I'll manage...

19:11.000 --> 19:15.710
These castle walls were built by the
High Wizard Eglacia in ancient times,

19:15.710 --> 19:18.580
and it is said they can withstand
any attack.

19:18.580 --> 19:21.040
Oh, the sparkly guy.

19:21.250 --> 19:22.630
You know of him?

19:22.630 --> 19:23.880
Sorta.

19:23.880 --> 19:25.380
Do you need something?

19:26.420 --> 19:29.920
I was just thinking that I'd guide you
if you don't mind.

19:35.000 --> 19:37.830
No one around here
should doubt your abilities,

19:37.830 --> 19:40.330
my pride will not allow them
to get away with it!

19:40.580 --> 19:41.630
Wow.

19:41.920 --> 19:46.080
He may not be a bad person,
but he kinda irks me.

19:46.920 --> 19:49.750
I noticed this earlier,
but there's an oddly large amount

19:49.750 --> 19:52.000
of people who practice martial arts,
aren't there?

19:52.170 --> 19:53.670
They are Explorers.

19:53.880 --> 19:56.170
And these are the warriors
who will challenge the Underworld.

19:56.170 --> 19:57.420
What's the Underworld?

19:57.420 --> 20:00.880
Below the royal capital
a Dark God is sealed,

20:00.880 --> 20:03.130
and his spawn are trying to escape.

20:03.130 --> 20:06.080
The "Dark God" in the canyon
isn't the only one?!

20:06.290 --> 20:07.920
I don't know about that.

20:07.920 --> 20:10.170
Shouldn't you,
the Knights of the Divine King,

20:10.170 --> 20:12.040
be more informed about it than me?

20:12.040 --> 20:13.380
Since we've come this far,

20:13.380 --> 20:15.290
we just need to keep
going straight, right?

20:15.290 --> 20:17.040
You don't have to show us any further.

20:17.210 --> 20:19.250
Okay then. Goodbye.

20:20.920 --> 20:24.500
Wasn't that a little cold to someone who
took their time to help us on our way?

20:24.500 --> 20:26.880
We'd have a hard time
talking about what comes next.

20:27.170 --> 20:28.580
What does come next?

20:29.170 --> 20:32.290
We're going to be meeting
our classmates soon.

20:32.630 --> 20:36.630
We gotta come up with an excuse
for how we escaped from the bus!

20:36.920 --> 20:38.580
Well, yeah, there's that.

20:38.580 --> 20:42.830
But first, you have to decide
whether you'll forgive them or not.

20:54.920 --> 20:58.130
This feels like
a school entrance ceremony.

20:58.380 --> 21:00.130
Were there always this many people?

21:03.830 --> 21:06.380
I heard from the Sage.

21:06.380 --> 21:09.500
I do appreciate all of you
coming from so far away.

21:10.080 --> 21:12.130
You all are Sage candidates,

21:12.130 --> 21:14.670
so you must have come here
for some sort of second mission.

21:14.670 --> 21:16.080
That mission is-

21:16.080 --> 21:17.500
Hold it right there!

21:17.500 --> 21:19.500
You're being way
too condescending right now.

21:19.710 --> 21:23.210
We're not your subjects
or anything, got it?

21:23.210 --> 21:25.380
Uh, who's that dumbass?

21:25.380 --> 21:27.670
That's Shinya Ushio-kun.

21:27.670 --> 21:30.920
I didn't realize he was
that bad at reading the room.

21:33.380 --> 21:35.210
This is the first time
I have witnessed anyone

21:35.210 --> 21:37.080
assume an attitude
such as this with me!

21:38.000 --> 21:39.920
Is that what you thought I would say?

21:46.000 --> 21:47.250
What?

21:47.580 --> 21:49.040
Someone help him!

21:49.040 --> 21:52.210
The Eroge Master's time freezing technique
wasn't invincible!

21:52.460 --> 21:54.460
What the hell is an "Eroge Master"?!

21:55.250 --> 21:57.420
It's time to shut your mouths.

22:00.500 --> 22:05.880
For you to become Sages you
must accomplish a great achievement.

23:36.830 --> 23:41.000
<b>"It's Like a Class Full of People Who Only Want to Save Themselves"</b>

23:37.420 --> 23:40.830
"It's Like a Class Full of People
Who Only Want to Save Themselves"
